1
00:00:00,295 --> 00:00:02,000
O polvo tem três corações.

2
00:00:03,485 --> 00:00:04,839
Já deixa o like aí,

3
00:00:04,849 --> 00:00:05,872
que vem coisa doida!

4
00:00:07,345 --> 00:00:08,722
Dois bombeiam sangue para as

5
00:00:08,732 --> 00:00:09,220
brânquias,

6
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:10,733
e o terceiro manda sangue

7
00:00:10,743 --> 00:00:11,766
para o resto do corpo.

8
00:00:13,245 --> 00:00:14,133
E o sangue dele é

9
00:00:14,143 --> 00:00:14,713
azul,

10
00:00:14,723 --> 00:00:15,906
por causa de uma proteína

11
00:00:15,916 --> 00:00:16,895
à base de cobre,

12
00:00:16,905 --> 00:00:17,666
a hemocianina.

13
00:00:19,145 --> 00:00:20,726
Dois terços dos neurônios dele

14
00:00:20,736 --> 00:00:21,874
ficam nos braços,

15
00:00:21,884 --> 00:00:22,725
não no cérebro.

16
00:00:24,205 --> 00:00:25,650
Por isso cada braço consegue

17
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:26,616
agir sozinho,

18
00:00:26,626 --> 00:00:28,252
explorando e agarrando sem esperar

19
00:00:28,262 --> 00:00:28,762
ordens.

20
00:00:30,255 --> 00:00:31,211
E ele ainda muda de

21
00:00:31,221 --> 00:00:32,461
cor e textura em frações

22
00:00:32,471 --> 00:00:33,040
de segundo.

23
00:00:34,525 --> 00:00:35,652
Se inscreve no canal e

24
00:00:35,662 --> 00:00:36,390
comenta:

25
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:37,754
qual desses fatos te assustou

26
00:00:37,764 --> 00:00:38,196
mais?

27
00:00:38,975 --> 00:00:39,397
Um,

28
00:00:39,407 --> 00:00:40,248
dois ou três?

